          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem tsum_norm_le_variation {f : ℝ → ℂ} (hf : Continuous f) (hfs : HasCompactSupport f)\n    {V : ℝ} (hV0 : 0 ≤ V) (hV : eVariationOn f Set.univ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal V) :\n    Summable (fun n : ℤ => ‖f n‖) ∧ ∑' n : ℤ, ‖f n‖ ≤ (∫ t, ‖f t‖) + V / 2 := by",
            "line": 407,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.tsum_norm_le_variation",
            "lines": [
              405,
              463
            ],
            "conclusion": "For continuous compactly supported `f` of variation `≤ V`: `Σ_n ‖f(n)‖ ≤ |f|₁ + V/2`, hence `|Σ f(n)e(αn)|` is at most `|f|₁ + V/2` (the first term with `f = η(·/x)`)."
